  "scope": [
    "Installs58 actual package files through native FileWrite and compiles Run.HC from C:/Home using its default FREEDOOM.WAD and TMDATA.BIN names; no flattened application preload.",
    "Observed native world and HUD through production one/four-worker VGA frames. Four-worker run uses shared memory and the ownership bus.",
    "Raw set1 P press and repeated make leave the world tic paused. Release and a second press resume. Held ArrowUp changes actual native player coordinates and the displayed world.",
    "Escape closes the first native task and removes its HUD; a fresh actual file launch accepts Shift-Escape and also closes without BSP/AP errors.",
    "A read-only native metadata probe checks actor positions and level tics. It does not replace game functions or change game memory."
